  "qualifications": [
    "SVGStringList.clear() leaves the requiredExtensions/systemLanguage attribute \"\" natively; Chromium 156 removes it (null). Both report numberOfItems 0 and a valid SVGTests element. The earlier \"systemLanguage \\\"\\\" after clear\" qualification therefore remains, now confined to the attribute value.",
    "systemLanguage serialises with \", \" natively (\"zz, zz\"); Chromium 156 serialises \"zz,zz\".",
    "requiredExtensions=\"\" holds one empty item natively; Chromium 156 reports numberOfItems 0.",
    "Chromium 156 repaints a conditional element only when its renderer is rebuilt; SVGTests validity is compared after re-appending the element (and the switch)."
